## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design robust RBAC in KCNA with per-tenant isolation, real-time token rotation, and auditable access.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant ACLs
- Token lifecycle and revocation
- Tamper-evident audit logs
- Read/write isolation and failure modes

## Code Example

````javascript
// Token validation sketch
function validate(token, tenant, topic) {
  const payload = decodeJWT(token);
  if (payload.tenant !== tenant || payload.topic !== topic) return false;
  return verifySignature(token);
}
````

